# The whole v10 story, one request at a time.
# VS Code: install "REST Client", start the server (uv run fastapi dev), then
# click "Send Request" above each block. Requests marked 💸 call the model.

@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### 1. Is it up?
GET {{base}}/health

### 2. Is it ready (graph built, databases open)?
GET {{base}}/ready

### 3. Create a thread for Ayesha. Copy the "id" from the response into @thread below.
POST {{base}}/v1/threads
Content-Type: application/json

{"customer_email": "ayesha@example.com"}

###
@thread = paste-the-thread-id-here

### 4. 💸 A policy question, streamed. Watch token, citation and done frames arrive.
POST {{base}}/v1/threads/{{thread}}/messages/stream
Content-Type: application/json

{"text": "Can I return headphones I opened 10 days ago?"}

### 5. 💸 Ask for a refund. The reply pauses: status awaiting_approval, with an interrupt.
POST {{base}}/v1/threads/{{thread}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{"text": "The headphones from ORD-5001 stopped working. I want my money back."}

### 6. The manager's inbox
GET {{base}}/v1/approvals

### 7. 💸 Approve it, with an Idempotency-Key
POST {{base}}/v1/threads/{{thread}}/resume
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 6f1c2a9e-0b7d-4f3e-9a51-2d8c4e7b1a00

{"type": "approve"}

### 8. The network dropped and the app retries: SAME key, SAME body.
#    Free: the stored response comes back with Idempotent-Replayed: true. One refund.
POST {{base}}/v1/threads/{{thread}}/resume
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 6f1c2a9e-0b7d-4f3e-9a51-2d8c4e7b1a00

{"type": "approve"}

### 9. Same key, DIFFERENT body: 422 idempotency-key-reused
POST {{base}}/v1/threads/{{thread}}/resume
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 6f1c2a9e-0b7d-4f3e-9a51-2d8c4e7b1a00

{"type": "reject", "reason": "changed my mind"}

### 10. The conversation so far
GET {{base}}/v1/threads/{{thread}}/messages

### 11. Every thread, newest first, two per page
GET {{base}}/v1/threads?limit=2

### 12. Errors are problem details: an unknown thread
GET {{base}}/v1/threads/does-not-exist

### 13. ...and a validation error, field by field
POST {{base}}/v1/threads/{{thread}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{"text": ""}

### 14. Delete the thread and its checkpoints
DELETE {{base}}/v1/threads/{{thread}}
